      en: ["Founded in 1775, it is now part of the Aburrá Valley metropolitan area.", "Consistently ranks at the top of the Colombian Quality of Life Index.", "Birthplace of the famous physician and geographer Manuel Uribe Ángel.", "The El Salado Eco-park is a key destination for nature lovers and hikers.", "The city is situated at an altitude of approximately 1,575 meters above sea level.", "Home to Envigado FC, a football club renowned for its world-class youth academy."],
