      en: ["Founded on December 14, 1570, by Francisco de Fernández.", "Located at a moderate elevation of 1,202 meters above sea level.", "Site of the historic Convention of Ocaña in 1828.", "Famous for the Sanctuary of the Virgin of Torcoroma.", "A leading producer of a specific variety of red onion in Colombia.", "The historical center of the city is designated as a National Monument."],
