      en: ["Founded on March 23, 1536, during the early conquest era.", "Located at an elevation of 840 meters above sea level.", "Famed for the 'Cholado,' a protected culinary heritage item.", "Home to the popular 'Parque de los Cholados' food park.", "A major center for rice production in the Valle del Cauca.", "The city experiences a warm climate with high rainfall near the peaks."],
